.etcs_history
.db
Makefile
# Loader build outputs -- mirrors loaders/Makefile's own `clean` target
# (Run_*Loader, etcs, *.o) so the two can't drift apart. This is what
# `2508dbe` committed by accident: a `git add .` after a build stages
# these unless they're ignored in both the dir they're built in and the
# dir copy_loaders moves them to.
loaders/Run_*Loader
loaders/etcs
loaders/*.o
logs/
bin/
bin/Run_*Loader
bin/etcs
bin/*.so
*_hashes.h
*db
